(28, '束皙冬虫夏草白细胞紧致抗皱胶原水', 1, '实物商品', 0, '', 1, '', 'upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525105624177972098412457.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525105623177972098381592.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525105623177972098377161.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525105623177972098364583.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525105623177972098321528.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525105623177972098313356.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525105623177972098313356.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525105623177972098314558.jpg', '<p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\">品牌：</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\"><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\">束皙</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\">产品名称：</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\"><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\">冬虫夏草白细胞紧致抗皱胶原水</span></strong><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\">产品净含量：</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\"><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\">120ml</span></strong><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></strong><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>功效：</strong></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\"><strong>精选于那曲地区海拔4000米以上的地方，生长的冬虫夏草中提取的虫草精粹。赋予肌肤紧致状态，帮助提升肌肤弹性，抗皱 提拉，淡化肌肤细纹，干纹，令肌肤紧润澎弹，焕现莹润饱满，平滑弹润的肌肤状态。</strong></span></p><div><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>特殊成分：</strong></span></p></div><div><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\"><strong>白细胞提取物：富含多种蛋白质和胶原蛋白，活性多肽，有益于皮肤护理。有效淡化纹路</strong></span></p></div><div><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\"><strong>冬虫夏草提取物：精选于那曲地区海拔4000米上的虫草，凝练出虫