(61, '膳养初胶原蛋白肽维C饮品2盒12支', 1, '实物商品', 0, '', 1, '', 'upload/1/common/images/20260601/20260601092608178032036804630.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260601/20260601092823178032050342585.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260601/20260601092907178032054798195.jpg', '<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(247,150,70);\"><br /></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(247,150,70);\">膳养初胶原饮，养出由内而外的透亮光！</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(247,150,70);\"></span></strong><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(247,150,70);\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(247,150,70);\"><br /></span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(247,150,70);\"></span></strong><img src=\"https://yanpanji.com/upload/1/common/images/20260601/20260601092608178032036804630.jpg\" alt=\"20260601092608178032036804630.jpg\" /></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:rgb(146,208,80);\"><strong>致每一个在生活里努力发光的你：</strong></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(84,141,212);\">一边扛着工作与生活的压力，一边悄悄消耗着自己的状态~</span></strong></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">别慌，膳养初来帮你「悄悄补回来」</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"> 每瓶6000mg高含量胶原肽，给肌肤补足“嘭弹底气”，对抗熬夜脸、垮脸危机</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"> GABA帮你舒缓紧绷的神经，告别焦虑疲惫，睡前喝一瓶，卸下一天的忙碌</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"> 维C加持，强抗氧化，养出透亮不发黄的好气色</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">不用复杂步骤，不用额外时间，揣在包里，忙完喝一口，酸甜果香里，藏着属于你的温柔滋养。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">你值得被好好对待，从这瓶胶原饮开始✨</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(247,150,70);\"></span></strong><img src=\"https://yanpanji.com/upload/1/common/images/20260601/20260601092823178032050342585.jpg\" alt=\"20260601092823178032050342585.jpg\" /><img src=\"https://yan