(30, 1, 27, '束皙冬虫夏草白细胞千肽紧致抗皱填充霜 ', '0004', '', '59.00', '88.00', '5.20', '59.00', 0, 0, 0, '10.000', '0.050', '0.001', 47, '1.000', 0, 'upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525084955177971339596074.jpg', 'upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525084955177971339596074.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525084958177971339884686.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525084957177971339706232.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525084957177971339737060.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525084958177971339815886.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525084958177971339818081.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525084957177971339767638.jpg,upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525084957177971339771742.jpg', 1, '实物商品', 0, '', '束皙冬虫夏草白细胞千肽紧致抗皱填充霜', '<div><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></strong><p><strong>产品详情</strong><br /></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span><strong>品牌：</strong><span style=\"color:rgb(255,192,0);\"><strong>束皙  </strong></span></p><p><strong>产品名称：</strong><span style=\"color:rgb(255,192,0);\"><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\">冬虫夏草白细胞千肽紧致抗皱填充霜</span></strong><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></strong></span></p><p><strong>产品净含量：</strong><span style=\"color:rgb(255,192,0);\"><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\">50g</span></strong><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></strong><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></strong></span></p><div><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>功效：</strong><span style=\"color:rgb(255,192,0);\"><strong>精选于那曲地区海拔4000米以上的地方，生长的冬虫夏草中提取的虫草精粹。赋予肌肤紧致状态，帮助提升肌肤弹性，抗皱提拉，淡化肌肤细纹，干纹，令肌肤紧润澎弹，焕现莹润饱满，平滑弹润的肌肤状态。</strong></span></p></div><div><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>特殊成分：</strong></p></div><div><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,192,0);\"><strong>•白细胞提取物：富含多种蛋白质和胶原蛋白，活性多肽，有益于皮肤护理。有效淡化纹路</strong></span></p></div><div><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,192,0);\"><strong>•冬虫夏草提取物：精选于那曲地区海拔4000米上的虫草，凝练出虫草精粹，密集润护，令肌肤弹润嫩滑</strong></span></p></div><div><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,192,0);\"><strong>•千肽（细小藻类多糖）：含有1000多条肽的组合，保湿锁水，肌肤爽滑湿润不紧绷</strong></span></p></div><div><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,192,0);\"><strong>•神经酰胺NP：修护屏障，增加表皮角质层厚度，提高皮肤持水能力，增强皮肤弹性，延迟皮肤衰老。</strong></span></p></div><p><img src=\"https://yanpanji.com/upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525093122177971588258074.jpg\" alt=\"20260525093122177971588258074.jpg\" /><br /></p><strong><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></strong><img src=\"https://yanpanji.com/upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525093122177971588250768.jpg\" alt=\"20260525093122177971588250768.jpg\" /><img src=\"https://yanpanji.com/upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525093123177971588382293.jpg\" alt=\"20260525093123177971588382293.jpg\" /><img src=\"https://yanpanji.com/upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525093123177971588387980.jpg\" alt=\"20260525093123177971588387980.jpg\" /><img src=\"https://yanpanji.com/upload/1/common/images/20260525/20260525093125177971588545161.jpg\" alt=\"20260525093125177971588545161.jpg\" /></div><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span><